  <name>raylib DOOM</name>
  <summary>The 1997 Linux DOOM source release, running on raylib</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.raydelto">
    <name>Raydelto Hernandez</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      DOOM, from the source id Software released for Linux in 1997
      (linuxdoom-1.10), ported from X11 and OSS to raylib and made to
      run on 64-bit systems. The original software renderer is kept:
      it draws the 320x200 paletted picture, which raylib shows scaled
      to 4:3, with sound effects and OPL3-emulated music.
    </p>
    <p>
      It needs game data (an IWAD): the free Freedoom, the shareware
      DOOM episode, or your own DOOM, Ultimate DOOM or DOOM II.
    </p>
  </description>
